    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Ascending Madness</strong> is a hardcore, psychedelic, twinstick shooter with a dark trippy vibe and fast fluid combat.<br><br>Take on the role of a merciless bounty hunter as he encounters increasing madness while on a mission.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750240/extras/08924432355ffd0bf619e3abd01e8cf1.avif?t=1567871991\" /></div><br><br><strong>Assassinate a renegade scientist and her group of devout followers who appear to have gone completely insane.</strong><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750240/extras/c3f41267ec1395997d54d45cdfd73707.avif?t=1567871991\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast Combat Across Diverse Arenas<br></li><li><strong>Bosses!</strong><br></li><li>Intense Futuristic Weaponry, like the <strong>'Flame Sword'</strong>, <strong>'Sniper Laser'</strong>, and <strong>'Pulverizer'</strong><br></li><li>Waves of <strong>Bizarre Monstrosities</strong><br></li><li>Interesting <strong>Rune Upgrades</strong> for your Battlecraft<br></li><li>Story Mode Involving the Psychedelic, the Spiritual, and the Surreal<br></li><li>Challenge Mode to Compete for High Scores<br></li><li>Colorful and Gritty Art Style<br></li><li>The Meaning of Life</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Ascending Madness</strong> is a hardcore, psychedelic, twinstick shooter with a dark trippy vibe and fast fluid combat.<br><br>Take on the role of a merciless bounty hunter as he encounters increasing madness while on a mission.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750240/extras/08924432355ffd0bf619e3abd01e8cf1.avif?t=1567871991\" /></div><br><br><strong>Assassinate a renegade scientist and her group of devout followers who appear to have gone completely insane.</strong><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750240/extras/c3f41267ec1395997d54d45cdfd73707.avif?t=1567871991\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast Combat Across Diverse Arenas<br></li><li><strong>Bosses!</strong><br></li><li>Intense Futuristic Weaponry, like the <strong>'Flame Sword'</strong>, <strong>'Sniper Laser'</strong>, and <strong>'Pulverizer'</strong><br></li><li>Waves of <strong>Bizarre Monstrosities</strong><br></li><li>Interesting <strong>Rune Upgrades</strong> for your Battlecraft<br></li><li>Story Mode Involving the Psychedelic, the Spiritual, and the Surreal<br></li><li>Challenge Mode to Compete for High Scores<br></li><li>Colorful and Gritty Art Style<br></li><li>The Meaning of Life</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Ascending Madness is a hardcore, psychedelic, twin-stick shooter adventure. Assassinate a renegade scientist who appears to have gone completely insane.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cLike some sort of twisted fairy tale, Ascending Madness is dazzling and disgusting all at the same time.\u201d<br>GameSpew<br><br>\u201cIt's a brilliantly frenetic little shooter with a killer soundtrack... The combat is the undoubted star of the show. Spraying enemies with a machine gun, running out of ammunition, dashing to escape enemy fire, switching to the shotgun instantaneously, and continuing to destroy enemies can be performed effortlessly in the game because the controls are tight and responsive.\u201d<br>OnlySP<br>",
